### Describe the bug

The sensors I recently purchased (temperature/humidity) paired successfully with the Tuya Zigbee experimental app on Homey, but they are not sending back any data.

### To Reproduce

Steps to reproduce the behavior:

1. Add the sensors to the Tuya Zigbee experimental app on Homey.
2. Pair the devices successfully without any error messages.
3. Monitor the sensors’ data updates in the Homey app.
4. Observe that no data is received from the sensors.

### Expected behavior

The sensors should send regular updates for humidity and temperature to Homey.

