### Device Information

- Device Name: Human Presence Sensor
- Device Model: ZSS-QY-HP
- Device Description: This mm-wave presence sensor uses ZigBee 3.0 protocol, recognizes any condition of people around: movement, sleeping, talking, accident, hitting eyes etc.
Detection angle 360°, detection distance adjustable from 0.3 m to 9 meters, sensitivity adjustable in 9 positions, detection time adjustable from 0-10 seconds, delay time adjustable from 1 second to 25 minutes.
Diameter 93mm, height 30mm, flush mounting, hole for cutting 77-80mm, after installation, it camouflages as a recessed light, aesthetically beautiful to look at, but ideal for use as anti-theft protection.
It is possible to connect the sensor to other ZigBee devices to create action zones, for example if the motion sensor turns on the light or attacks an acoustic alarm.

https://manuals.plus/moes/be09-220509-human-presence-sensor-manual

- Link to device image: https://moeshouse.com/products/smart-ceiling-motion-detection


