This device is already integrated in the „test version“. I have been testing this device in different operation scenarios with the test version of the app. It works very well, therefore I would like to request  to release this device to the official app version.

Moreover I‘d like to ask about a feature extension for this device:
- possibility to configure the default power-on state(on or off) for each relay after reboot (e.g. when power supply for the device  was cut off and repowered again).  It would be nice to be able to configure such default power-on state within the app (for each relay separately). The following 3 configurable power-on states would be useful: 
- on, 
- off, 
- last state before power off

